{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/333f029d9db2e30d0bb4f2318207884d.avif?t=1755627685\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL VERSION 1.0</strong> <br><strong>Part 1 of 2: The All Bearer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mana shall shatter and be reborn as drums pound to the rhythm of roses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A crimson darkness envelops the radiant moon above Azmoria, carving an indelible tale into the celestite archives. Fate intertwines two factions, setting the stage for an epic showdown of power. A new saga of heroes must unite to confront their intertwined pasts and a tumultuous present, as an unstoppable supervillain rises from the dead, intent on claiming dominion over all celestites/yokai souls. This is the first part of a two-part, story-driven RPG series inspired by a draft novel by Raven Burns.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legends of Celestite Part 1: The All Bearer, threads emotional manga storytelling and classic JRPG pastimes into a unique, action-packed world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>TURN-BASED ELEMENTAL COMBAT!</strong></u> - Legends of Celestite RPG combines intense battles with a rich dark fantasy/anime-esque storyline. Each ally who joins the player can fill several roles in combat, such as Tank, DPS, Debuffer, Healer, or Supporter. The battle system also features element-based damage and special aura buffs, adding strategic depth to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ANIMATED ATB BATTLE SYSTEM!</strong></u>- The battle sprites are animated, not static! Fast-paced and punchy ATB System! Unleash combo additions and build your Cross-Skill Meter for more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Collectibles and Secrets</strong></u> await you in Azmoria. Discover Abacus Tokens that help unlock the rarest items/weapons/armours and chests within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>POWER &amp; CONTROL!</u></strong> - Unlock abilities with CP (Celestite Points) and learn/empower your abilities the way you want to.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Adventurer's note:</strong> We strongly recommend playing the game in Window Mode. You can do this by pressing F3 on your keyboard to minimize the screen. You can still use Full-Screen while doing this.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/9a49e6f5cc845619b45173ba860534bf.avif?t=1755627685\" data-has-big width=800 height=1242 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1699950?t=1755627685","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755627685","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755627685","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755627685","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/333f029d9db2e30d0bb4f2318207884d.avif?t=1755627685\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FULL VERSION 1.0</strong> <br><strong>Part 1 of 2: The All Bearer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Mana shall shatter and be reborn as drums pound to the rhythm of roses.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A crimson darkness envelops the radiant moon above Azmoria, carving an indelible tale into the celestite archives. Fate intertwines two factions, setting the stage for an epic showdown of power. A new saga of heroes must unite to confront their intertwined pasts and a tumultuous present, as an unstoppable supervillain rises from the dead, intent on claiming dominion over all celestites/yokai souls. This is the first part of a two-part, story-driven RPG series inspired by a draft novel by Raven Burns.</i>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Legends of Celestite Part 1: The All Bearer, threads emotional manga storytelling and classic JRPG pastimes into a unique, action-packed world.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES:</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>TURN-BASED ELEMENTAL COMBAT!</strong></u> - Legends of Celestite RPG combines intense battles with a rich dark fantasy/anime-esque storyline. Each ally who joins the player can fill several roles in combat, such as Tank, DPS, Debuffer, Healer, or Supporter. The battle system also features element-based damage and special aura buffs, adding strategic depth to each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>ANIMATED ATB BATTLE SYSTEM!</strong></u>- The battle sprites are animated, not static! Fast-paced and punchy ATB System! Unleash combo additions and build your Cross-Skill Meter for more powerful attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Collectibles and Secrets</strong></u> await you in Azmoria. Discover Abacus Tokens that help unlock the rarest items/weapons/armours and chests within the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>POWER &amp; CONTROL!</u></strong> - Unlock abilities with CP (Celestite Points) and learn/empower your abilities the way you want to.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Adventurer's note:</strong> We strongly recommend playing the game in Window Mode. You can do this by pressing F3 on your keyboard to minimize the screen. You can still use Full-Screen while doing this.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/extras/9a49e6f5cc845619b45173ba860534bf.avif?t=1755627685\" data-has-big width=800 height=1242 /></span></p>","developers":["Raven Burns"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1699950/header.jpg?t=1755627685","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. No part of this publication may be reproduced, copied or transmitted in any form or by any means. That includes photocopying, taking photos, recording, or any other electronic or mechanical strategies, without the prior written permission of the publisher. This agreement, however, excludes brief quotations embodied in critical reviews and specific non-commercial uses permitted by copyright law.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1829630021/e147ba2a3be5cb3aea9ac04c20f3aa560cd3652b/1751021229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749354977","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1829630021/e147ba2a3be5cb3aea9ac04c20f3aa560cd3652b/1751021229/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749354977","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1699950/1829630021/e147ba2a3be5cb3aea9ac04c20f3aa560cd3652b/1751021229/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749354977","id":257001895,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257001895/movie480.mp4?t=1749354977","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257001895/movie_max.mp4?t=1749354977"},"name":"Story/Reveal Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea